<p>This tutorial describes how to create a custom <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Item" title="Item">Item</a> by recoloring an existing item. It is assumed that the reader is familiar with the Toolset. These instructions are based on a forum post by Dylbot.
</p>
