<h1><span class="mw-headline" id="Getting_Started">Getting Started</span></h1>
<p>Open the item you want to recolor. For the purposes of this tutorial, we're going to go for heavy chainmail.
</p><p>If creating a new item, to select heavy chainmail, in the toolset click File&gt;New&gt;Item and change the "Base Item Type" to "Armor - Heavy" and the "Item Variation" should be set to "Heavy Armor C".
To modify all heavy chainmail worn by every character, in the toolset, click either "Item" (sword icon) or "All" (icon with the word: All) in the <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Resource%20palette" title="Resource palette">Resource palette</a> then in the tree of folders below expand "_Global" &gt; "Armour, Chest" &gt; "Heavy", then right click the item "gen_im_arm_cht_hvy_hch.uti (Heavy Chainmail)" and choose "Check Out".
</p><p><a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/File%20-%20HeavyChainmail.jpg"><img alt="HeavyChainmail.jpg" src="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/main/Wiki/assets/mw/images/5/57/HeavyChainmail.jpg" width="800" height="623" /></a>
</p>
