<p><a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/File%20-%20CreateNewMaterial.jpg"><img alt="CreateNewMaterial.jpg" src="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/main/Wiki/assets/mw/images/1/18/CreateNewMaterial.jpg" width="417" height="573" /></a>
